Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.20,Badge,,0,0,0,,5 SECRETS EMPLOYERS USE
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.20,0:00:20.60,Badge,,0,0,0,,#5  THE DARK TEST
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.60,0:00:30.20,Badge,,0,0,0,,#4  BRAIN GAMES
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.20,0:00:37.30,Badge,,0,0,0,,#3  YOUR SECRET COMPETITION
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.30,0:00:45.80,Badge,,0,0,0,,#2  SOMEONE'S WATCHING
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.80,0:00:55.00,Badge,,0,0,0,,#1  THE HIDDEN LIST
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.00,0:01:03.90,Handle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)}@Bizstring
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.30,0:01:03.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)}FOLLOW FOR MORE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Five secret ways employers judge you before you're even hired
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.10,0:00:07.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,The last one is a list you might not know you're on
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.30,0:00:08.50,Hit,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,120,\fscx100\fscy100)}NUMBER 5
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.50,0:00:10.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,A test with no right answers
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.20,0:00:12.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's called a {\c&H2E2FD8&}dark personality test
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,The {\c&H2E2FD8&}Hogan{\c&HFFFFFF&} is the best known
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.60,0:00:16.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,It measures how you act under stress
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.90,0:00:20.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,and some tests screen for {\c&H2E2FD8&}narcissism{\c&HFFFFFF&} and {\c&H2E2FD8&}manipulation
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.70,0:00:21.40,Hit,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,120,\fscx100\fscy100)}4
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.40,0:00:22.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Brain games
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.60,0:00:25.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,That quick game in your application isn't just a game
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.70,0:00:28.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,It can measure how {\c&H2E2FD8&}impulsive{\c&HFFFFFF&} you are
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.30,0:00:30.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,and how much risk you take
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.30,Hit,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,120,\fscx100\fscy100)}3
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,You're compared to people you've never met
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.90,0:00:37.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,AI scores your resume against the people they {\c&H2E2FD8&}already hired
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.40,0:00:38.20,Hit,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,120,\fscx100\fscy100)}2
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.20,0:00:40.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Someone's watching your feed
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.00,0:00:42.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,AI tools scan your public posts
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.40,0:00:45.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,and some companies keep scanning {\c&H2E2FD8&}after you're hired
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.90,0:00:47.20,Hit,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,120,\fscx100\fscy100)}NUMBER 1
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.20,0:00:51.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Some U.S. retailers share databases of workers accused of {\c&H2E2FD8&}theft
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.90,0:00:55.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Some people on those lists were {\c&H2E2FD8&}never even charged
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.10,0:00:58.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,What's the worst thing an employer has ever done to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.85,0:01:00.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tell me in the comments
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.40,0:01:03.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Like and share with someone who's job hunting
